            "img": "shopify://shop_images/3_1.jpg",
            "img_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/3_1.jpg",
            "title": "Who We are",
            "text": "<p>Founded in 2018, moodytiger is a global children’s sports lifestyle brand committed to creating high-performance, stylish apparel made just for kids.<br/><br/>From tennis and swimming to skiing, skating, and beyond, our collections are built to support every move. Our signature leggings have remained bestsellers for years — loved by kids and trusted by parents.<br/><br/>Engineered with comfort, sustainability, and freedom in mind, our designs feature lightweight fabrics, no-restriction fits, and eco-conscious materials — empowering children aged 4–16 to explore the world confidently and joyfully.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_9V8mYt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/3_2_a38f3229-d93c-4009-8a8d-d50a70c15df1.jpg",
            "img_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/3_2_a38f3229-d93c-4009-8a8d-d50a70c15df1.jpg",
            "title": "Why moodytiger?",
            "text": "<p>\"Moody\" embodies emotional versatility and the courage to stay true to ourselves. \"Tiger\", as a majestic and energetic creature, represents bravery and self-confidence. Combined together, \"moody\" and \"tiger\" encapsulate what we perceive as the essence of the \"new generation\". <br/><br/>From our perspective, the new generation could be... <br/>Optimists unbothered by gains or losses; Intrepid adventurers who enjoy exploring all kinds of newness driven by curiosity; Enthusiastic go-getters who go boldly to pursue their passions, treating the world as their playground. <br/><br/>They are a group of children with boundless potential, capable of achieving even greater things than adults. </p>"
          }
        }
